>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `LINARITH_ext_ss`

``` hol4
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss : simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides the extension-engine version of `LINARITH_ss`.

The fragment behaves as [`LINARITH_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ss), including
reading the global `[arith]` facts, but is for adding to a `simpExtLib`
simpset.

### Failure

As for [`LINARITH_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ss).

### Example

``` hol4
val arithmetic_ss = simpExtLib.++
  (simpExtLib.lift_simpset (BasicProvers.srw_ss ()),
   linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss);
```

### See also

[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ss),
